New: Struct Portable::internal::batched::EvaluatorTensorProduct supporting
batched processing of points has been added. The new struct allows for
simpler definition than current Porable::internal::EvaluatorTensorProduct
via apply_matrix_vector_product() function, and the new struct is meant to
replace the current one in coming months. Additionally, fused evaluation of
the gradients in the collocation space actoss all direction has been added
allowing for faster execution on GPUs.
<br>
(Ivan Prusak, Enes Soydan, Ivan Pribec, Martin Kronbichler, 2026/09/09)
